      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وافزهُ</span></b>  <i>He hastened with him; vied,</i> or <i>strove,
with him in hastening;</i> or <i>made haste to be,</i> or
<i>get, before him;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَاجَلَهُ</span>. (A, TA.)

